# Scratch material that must stay out of the repository.
#
# These are not work in progress. docs/research/ and docs/specs/ are restorations of
# point-in-time documents this repository deliberately does not keep, and tools/audit_docs.py
# fails the build the moment they are tracked again — which is exactly what happened once,
# through a careless `git add -A`. The rest are duplicates of committed content or scratch
# extracts. Ignoring them means a blanket add cannot resurrect them by accident.

docs/research/
docs/specs/
_merge_stash/
